     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total land area (Ha) is defined as: number of hectares covered by licit crops, limited to the number of hectares of crops that the project has introduced to farmers. This will only include new areas cultivated by CBARD interventions in Kandahar as the baseline value already includes the total ha of orchards, vineyards and greenhouses built by MAIL in the past, so rehabilitated facilities would be double-counting. Criteria for cultivation include the distribution of inputs including saplings and grapevines. This is the only indicator where the number of saplings and vineyards distributed in Kandahar can be counted and reported in narrative description; no new saplings or orchards to be distributed in any other province henceforth.</narrative>
